[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891632\">3330D20</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the brake servo pipe from the inlet manifold.</p><p>2. Remove the pipe from the engine compartment.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034964.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the vacuum pipe, connecting it to the\ninlet manifold.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891632\">3330D20</a></p>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891632\">3330D20</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the vacuum pipe from the vacuum unit.</p><p>2. Disconnect the vacuum pipe for the EGR sytem from the T-connector\nwith the E.G.R. solenoid valve pipe.</p><p>3. Remove the vacuum pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034965.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the vacuum pipe for the EGR sytem\nto the T-connector.</p><p>Connect the vacuum pipe to the vacuum unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891632\">3330D20</a></p>"]]